# The chat app in landscape with the keyboard up (docs/safe-area-plan.md A17):
# the composer and the keyboard cover the thread, which may be 0 pt tall, so
# nothing is asserted of the thread while the keyboard is up. A phone's script,
# run by an app pinned to landscape (A13: the desktops have no software keyboard).
expect_title "chat"
click row@convo[maya]
click button@newest
expect_scrolled_to column@thread m30
click textarea@compose
expect_focused textarea@compose
expect_keyboard on
expect_safe textarea@compose
type "On my way"
press return
expect_keyboard on
expect_safe textarea@compose
